     "I am currently working on a research scale and we want to provide the ability for future practitioners to use this scale and produce a factorial score (latent score) when used. <br>To do this we want to produce an Excel sheet and programme score using VBA (just for context not usefull). <br>I need to transfer the calculation method to VBA, but first I want to check my calculation method on R since MIRT provide both <br><br>I want to produce 2 latent scores ML and EAP. I think I succeeded to produce ML in a Rasch model with 1 factor. <br>However when I compare the result are not the same and I am pretty sure I get the formulation wrong. <br><br>I used Phil Crammer&#39;s answer here to test my calculation (<a href=\"https://stats.stackexchange.com/questions/34119/estimating-ability-using-irt-when-the-model-parameters-are-known\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://stats.stackexchange.com/questions/34119/estimating-ability-using-irt-when-the-model-parameters-are-known&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792470699838000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2k6y6YcxMZt2HzTb_OyhVU\">https://stats.stackexchange.com/questions/34119/estimating-ability-using-irt-when-the-model-parameters-are-known</a>).<br><br>So what did I miss or did worg ? <br><br>Here is my complete code.<div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(190,207,218);background-color:rgb(7,39,59);font-family:Consolas,&quot;Courier New&quot;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;white-space:pre\"><br><div><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">d</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(73,214,233)\">c</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">2</span>,<span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">2</span>) <span style=\"color:rgb(89,136,166);font-style:italic\"># model parameter </span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">pattern</span>  <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(73,214,233)\">c</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">0</span>) <span style=\"color:rgb(89,136,166);font-style:italic\"># Participant response pattern</span></div><br><br><br><div><span style=\"color:rgb(89,136,166);font-style:italic\"># Testing ground to produce Maximun Likeood latent score and EAP </span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">theta</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(73,214,233)\">seq</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">5</span>,<span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">5</span>,<span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">0.0001</span>)</div><br><div><span style=\"color:rgb(89,136,166);font-style:italic\"># The item response function</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(22,163,182)\">IRF</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(230,101,51);font-style:italic\">function</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">difficulty</span>,<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">theta</span>){</div><div>  <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">p</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> ((<span style=\"color:rgb(73,214,233)\">exp</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">theta</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">difficulty</span>)<span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">/</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">+</span> (<span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">1</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">+</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(73,214,233)\">exp</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">theta</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">difficulty</span>))))</div><div>  <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">return</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">p</span>)</div><div>}</div><br><div><span style=\"color:rgb(22,163,182)\">IRF</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">2</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">theta</span>) <span style=\"color:rgb(89,136,166);font-style:italic\"># Work fine </span></div><br><div><span style=\"color:rgb(22,163,182)\">ML</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(230,101,51);font-style:italic\">function</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">response.pattern</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">difficulty</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">theta</span>){</div><div>  <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">ML</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(73,214,233)\">c</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">1</span>)</div><div>  <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">for</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">rp</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">in</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(73,214,233)\">length</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">response.pattern</span>)){</div><div>    <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">d</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">difficulty</span>[<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">rp</span>]</div><div>    <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">tmp</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(22,163,182)\">IRF</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">d</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">theta</span>)<span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">^</span><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">response.pattern</span>[<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">rp</span>] <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">*</span> (<span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">1</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(22,163,182)\">IRF</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">d</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">theta</span>))<span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">^</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">response.pattern</span>[<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">rp</span>])</div><div>    <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">ML</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">ML</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">*</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">tmp</span></div><div>  }</div><div>  <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">return</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">ML</span>)</div><div>}</div><br><div><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">tmp</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(73,214,233)\">data.frame</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">theta</span>,<span style=\"color:rgb(22,163,182)\">ML</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">pat</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">d</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">theta</span>)) <span style=\"color:rgb(89,136,166);font-style:italic\"># ML work fine </span></div><br><br><div><span style=\"color:rgb(89,136,166);font-style:italic\"># EAP not working </span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">ml</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">=</span>  <span style=\"color:rgb(22,163,182)\">ML</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">pat</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">d</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">theta</span>)</div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">w</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> (<span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(73,214,233)\">sqrt</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">*</span><span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">3.14</span>))<span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">*</span><span style=\"color:rgb(73,214,233)\">exp</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">-</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">theta</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">^</span><span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">2</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">2</span>))</div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">EAP</span>  <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(73,214,233)\">sum</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">theta</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">*</span><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">w</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">*</span><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">ml</span>)<span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(73,214,233)\">sum</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">theta</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">*</span><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">ml</span>)</div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">EAP</span></div><br><br><br><div><span style=\"color:rgb(89,136,166);font-style:italic\">## Verification method </span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(89,136,166);font-style:italic\">#generates set of random response patterns for 5 items</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">dat</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(73,214,233)\">matrix</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(73,214,233)\">sample</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(73,214,233)\">c</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">0</span>,<span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">1</span>), <span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">20000</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">TRUE</span>), <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">ncol</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">5</span>)</div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(73,214,233)\">colnames</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">dat</span>)<span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(73,214,233)\">paste0</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(73,233,166)\">&#39;Item&#39;</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">:</span><span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">5</span>)</div><br><div><span style=\"color:rgb(73,214,233)\">library</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">mirt</span>)</div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(89,136,166);font-style:italic\">#2PL Model </span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">sv</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(22,163,182)\">mirt</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">dat</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">,</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">1</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">,</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">itemtype</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(73,233,166)\">&#39;Rasch&#39;</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">,</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">pars</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(73,233,166)\">&#39;values&#39;</span>)</div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">sv</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">value</span>[<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">sv</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">name</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">==</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(73,233,166)\">&#39;d&#39;</span>] <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">d</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">*-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">1</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(89,136,166);font-style:italic\">#set item parameters as fixed</span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">sv</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">$</span><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">est</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">FALSE</span></div><br><div><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">mod</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(22,163,182)\">mirt</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">dat</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">,</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">1</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">,</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">pars</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">sv</span>)</div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(73,214,233)\">coef</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">mod</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">simplify</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">TRUE</span>)</div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(73,214,233)\">coef</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">mod</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">simplify</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">TRUE</span>, <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">IRTpars</span><span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(112,96,235)\">TRUE</span>)</div><br><div><span style=\"color:rgb(22,163,182)\">fscores</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">mod</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">method</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(73,233,166)\">&quot;ML&quot;</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">,</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">response.pattern</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(223,118,155);font-weight:bold\">=</span> <span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">pat</span>)</div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(22,163,182)\">fscores</span>(<span style=\"color:rgb(228,183,129)\">mod</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">,</span><span style=